   "value": "<p><em>Faceless God — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you learn to directly inject madness into a creature. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with a melee attack while your technique is active, they gain a 5% increase to <em>Mental Corruption</em>. You can spend additional cursed energy up to your proficiency bonus on a hit to increase <em>Mental Corruption</em> by 5% per cursed energy spent.</p>",
